  "title": "Unit 2.2 - The American Court System",
  "language": "en",
  "intro": "Trace the roles and review vocabulary in the supplied federal-court classroom exercise. Its trademark dispute is a historical teaching scenario, not a statement of current trademark law or a universal route for challenging an agency.",
